  "name": "[EN556 bulk water polysaccharide hydrolysis rates] - Hydrolysis rates from bulk water sample incubations from R/V Endeavor cruise EN556 in 2015 (Latitudinal and depth-related contrasts in enzymatic capabilities of pelagic microbial communities: Predictable patterns in the ocean?)",
